      "Faqat tizim o\u02BBzi hisoblab yozgan katak sanaladi (summa, jami, nakrutka \u2014 formula). Matn, ish nomlari va hujjatdan ko\u02BBchirilgan sonlar sanalmaydi. Tekshirish: Excel \u2192 \xAB\u0412\u044B\u0434\u0435\u043B\u0438\u0442\u044C \u0433\u0440\u0443\u043F\u043F\u0443 \u044F\u0447\u0435\u0435\u043A\xBB \u2192 \xAB\u0424\u043E\u0440\u043C\u0443\u043B\u044B\xBB.": "Only cells the system calculated itself are counted (amounts, totals, mark-ups \u2014 formulas). Text, work names and numbers copied from a document are not counted. Check: Excel \u2192 Go To Special \u2192 Formulas.",
      "Masalan: F2 (213 hisoblangan katak) = {s} so\u02BBm = {n} token": "Example: F-2 (213 calculated cells) = {s} UZS = {n} tokens",
      "Hujjatlarda birlik \u2014 tizim o\u02BBzi hisoblagan katak (formula). Matn va hujjatdan ko\u02BBchirilgan sonlar sanalmaydi. Masalan, 43 qatorli F2 da 213 ta hisoblangan katak bor.": "For documents the unit is a cell the system calculated (formula). Text and numbers copied from a document are not counted. For example, a 43-row F-2 has 213 calculated cells.",
      "Sinov: hujjatdagi hisoblangan kataklar soni": "Test: number of calculated cells in a document",
      "\u2014 qiymatlarni o\u02BBzgartiring, \xABMisol\xBB ustuni darhol yangilanadi (saqlamaguncha hech narsa o\u02BBzgarmaydi)": "\u2014 change the values and the Example column updates at once (nothing changes until you save)",
      "AI ustamasi": "AI mark-up",
      "Mijozdan olinadigan AI narxi = provayder haqiqiy sarfi \xD7 (1 + ustama%) \u2192 so\u02BBm \u2192 token (kamida 1 token). Kompaniyaga alohida ustama \u2014 AI markazi \u2192 Xarajat.": "AI price for the customer = actual provider cost \xD7 (1 + mark-up %) \u2192 UZS \u2192 tokens (at least 1 token). A separate mark-up per company \u2014 AI centre \u2192 Costs.",
